    intro1: 'Anaga oo ah koox ka buuxa ciyaartoyda & qulqulaya, waxaan dhisnay oo aan sii deynay tiro badan oo xiiso leh, ciyaaro arcade lacag la \'aan ah oo aan ka shaqeyneyno kulankeena ugu horreeya ee calanka, Last Chad Standing, oo ah kooxdii ugu horreysay ee MMA Battle Royale, oo leh koox ka socota kuwa jecel Ubisoft iyo sidoo kale koox aasaasi ah oo si weyn ugu lug leh UFC, Oktagon iyo PFL xiddigaha, oo duubay dukumiintiyo sida Jhamps Jorge Masvid, iyo tababarka Conregor Mcavor. Dukumiintiyada waxaa sidoo kale duubay Luke Barnatt, oo ah madaxa qolka dagaalka ee Andrew Tate iyo slugger-kii hore ee UFC, oo ku yaal Be half of DeHub.',
    intro2: 'A play iyo kasbado model joogtada ah gebi ahaanba on jiilka khidmadda hubinta ma dilution ama sicir bararka loo baahan yahay si ay u dhiirrigeliyaan ka qaybqaadashada, loops feedback wanaagsan & koritaanka guud.',
